Description: An R implementation of the Grouping-Scoring-Modeling (G-S-M)
    framework for transcriptomic data analysis. Groups genes based on prior
    biological knowledge (e.g. disease associations, pathways), scores groups
    using machine learning classifiers, and builds predictive models from
    top-ranked groups. Supports Monte Carlo cross-validation with pluggable
    backends for pre-scoring, scoring, and modeling steps.
